# Explicitly installed packages on voidbox, grouped by role.
#
# Source of truth is `xbps-query -m`; ./sync-from-system.sh reconciles this file
# with it and reports drift. Names only, no versions, so the list is directly
# consumable: ./install.sh feeds it to xbps-install.
#
# Blank lines and everything from a '#' to end of line are ignored by both
# scripts. Dependencies are deliberately absent -- xbps pulls them in.

